{
  "abstract": null,
  "content": "<div class=\"qz-editor-engine am-engine\" data-element=\"root\" data-listener-added_7904a17e=\"true\"><blockquote data-id=\"b603af74-JNMX5lfk\" style=\"margin-top: 5px; margin-bottom: 5px; padding-left: 1em; margin-left: 0px; border-left: 3px solid rgb(238, 238, 238); opacity: 0.6;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-7KIaoEHp\">本章节为您介绍如何成为Marketing API开发者</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-QXXWqoV3\">在调用Marketing API前，您必须先注册成为开发者、创建应用并申请对应接口权限。以下将分别为您介绍注册、创建应用、获取权限的具体流程。</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-ugqPRhvl\">请注意重点关注文档中加粗、标注部分的描述。</p></blockquote><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-Y0dEHSBS\" id=\"link-0\">1、如何注册成为开发者？</h1><p data-id=\"p838747a-6TureSwm\">在使用Marketing API接口功能前，需要您先注册成为开发者</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-1UYHmNmE\"><strong>Step1</strong>：进入注册页面。点击开放平台官网右上角【<a href=\"https://ad.oceanengine.com/openapi/register.html?rid=erj3lme7sha\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"blank\"><span style=\"color: #1890ff;\">注册</span></a>】按钮即可进入</p><p data-id=\"pa028eb2-T2Z4k5ll\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img data-auto=\"true\" data-type=\"inline\" src=\"https://p3-business-sign.byteadimg.com/tos-cn-i-yvqzo4lhg5/9b66b832132f4ace8c90298df9146590~noop.image?x-expires=1988615745&amp;x-signature=Sz4VxuhKeGGh1gZvaQ6pKkSXQYY%3D\" style=\"width: 2000px; visibility: visible; height: auto;\"/></p><p data-id=\"p838747a-hYyAsdCE\"><strong>Tips：</strong></p><ol data-id=\"o9d5df12-X5ckNXTG\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-0XWca7FH\"><strong>对于企业开发者，建议使用公司邮箱账户进行注册，并妥善管理，一个公司信息仅能注册认证一个开发者账户</strong></li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-9HSjIZ0E\">如果您已有巨量引擎账户，可选择左下角登录，登录对应账号</li></ol><p data-id=\"p838747a-yupKI0D2\"><strong>Step2</strong>：注册完成后会自动登录进入巨量开放平台，点击开放平台官网右上角【<a href=\"https://ad.oceanengine.com/openapi/developer/info.html?rid=dp10b9hd3e6\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"blank\"><span style=\"color: #1890ff;\">注册为开发者</span></a>】，继续完善填写信息并通过企业认证，即完成开发者注册。</p><p data-id=\"pa028eb2-ITLnL51V\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img data-auto=\"true\" data-type=\"inline\" src=\"https://p26-business-sign.byteadimg.com/tos-cn-i-yvqzo4lhg5/c470bf679d364603ab3151c98116552d~noop.image?x-expires=1988615745&amp;x-signature=tF5a1xd4toMVWBn3JlPv0Y%2BOIxE%3D\" style=\"width: 2000px; visibility: visible; height: auto;\"/></p><p data-id=\"p838747a-WMStmfQ1\"><strong>Tips</strong>:</p><ol data-id=\"o9d5df12-YAAQlmC4\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-dGUDQUc3\">填写您期望用于后续接收开放平台短信/邮件通知的手机号/邮箱信息，与注册开发者账号时填入的手机号/信息不需要保持一致</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-c2ga4YmP\">该部分需完成企业信息填写，并完成企业打款认证</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-kRZGdSKD\"><span style=\"color: #1890ff;\"><strong>完成合同签订后，请在【</strong></span><a href=\"https://ad.oceanengine.com/openapi/account/index.html?rid=zd9jstnnbz#/account\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"blank\"><span style=\"color: #1890ff;\"><strong>账号信息</strong></span></a><span style=\"color: #1890ff;\"><strong>】界面激活您的信息接收邮箱，并可添加新的联系人信息用于接收通知</strong></span></li></ol><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-DLchaK5J\" id=\"link-1\">2、如何创建应用程序并申请权限</h1><p data-id=\"p838747a-MHN79ILH\">创建的应用程序是指基于Marketing API开发的应用，如管理营销的投放平台、数据分析工具、DMP人群自动化管理等。 创建应用程序后可申请开放的功能接口使用权限，对授权客户进行管理操作。</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-idn43xWI\"><br/></p><p data-id=\"p838747a-PHgvsVfc\"> </p><p data-id=\"p838747a-GjpHV5QC\"><strong>Step1</strong>：认证通过成为开发者后，在开发者官网进行登录并进入「<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/developer/admin/service_list\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"blank\"><span style=\"color: #1890ff;\">APPID管理</span></a>」页面，可选择创建应用，如下图：</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-EDqk0aKu\"><img data-auto=\"true\" data-type=\"inline\" src=\"https://p3-business-sign.byteadimg.com/tos-cn-i-yvqzo4lhg5/453bbb24ca6344139ed7e35f1421f367~noop.image?rk3s=d3394059&amp;x-expires=2054784133&amp;x-signature=pmpq1KuEGyYDE12CE4fETDuAbkw%3D\" style=\"width: 2000px; visibility: visible; height: auto;\"/></p><p data-id=\"pa028eb2-WOeP3CUR\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><br/></p><p data-id=\"p838747a-TTgq08YI\"><strong>Step2</strong>：确定应用类型后，进入创建应用程序界面，填写应用名称、图标、申请权限等。下图以营销管理应用为例：</p><p data-id=\"pa028eb2-ie8eeGP9\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img alt=\"image 26.png\" data-auto=\"true\" data-type=\"inline\" src=\"https://p6-business-sign.byteadimg.com/tos-cn-i-yvqzo4lhg5/a64e709b6f6d49579c02ba417d10e490~noop.image?x-expires=1988615745&amp;x-signature=BAxzO3%2BLfX3VUMryXpE%2BrbTQV18%3D\" style=\"width: 2000px; visibility: visible; height: auto;\" title=\"image 26.png\"/></p><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-LUF8RL2Z\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-NqNR0K86\">应用名称：应用程序的名称（2-50个字符）</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-gKXRremG\">应用图标：推荐尺寸72*72，要求同比例尺寸、大小1M以内，格式支持jpg、png，会展示在客户授权页面上</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-IfrP7PFs\">回调地址：用户自定义的链接地址，用户同意完成授权后，Marketing API会将授权相关信息和status拼接至该回调地址</li></ul><p data-id=\"pa028eb2-8bAKSVB5\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img alt=\"WX20210513-153559@2x.png\" data-auto=\"true\" data-type=\"inline\" src=\"https://p6-business-sign.byteadimg.com/tos-cn-i-yvqzo4lhg5/1692e820a4df45918e2ba58dd7a8099f~noop.image?x-expires=1988615745&amp;x-signature=Avitr24FFXk2xvy9Ce74Ne7jP04%3D\" style=\"width: 2000px; visibility: visible; height: auto;\" title=\"WX20210513-153559@2x.png\"/></p><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-JAWc98Oa\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-undsMIOk\">服务场景：千川营销平台API与原巨量营销平台API 是独立的两套API机制，故在应用设计上做了类型区分（千川的应用仅可调用访问千川的API，巨量同理）</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-jRbHhFP5\">应用角色：根据自身实际场景进行申请</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-Nvun6Ido\">申请权限：请结合自身开发诉求选择需要的权限，可以提前考虑长期的对接目标，一次申请相应功能权限</li></ul><p data-id=\"p838747a-qtHAPWD8\"><strong>Step3</strong>：填写确认提交后，将在一个工作日内审核完成您的应用创建（APPID）申请</p><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-nB4oMGTe\" id=\"link-4\">3、发起请求</h1><h2 data-id=\"h490b8bf-H9OXVjN2\" id=\"link-5\">3.1 申请客户授权</h2><p data-id=\"p838747a-qGW20BMa\">拥有开发者应用程序后，需要申请客户授权并获取AccessToken后，才可以通过接口对客户进行管理操作。系统会在校验Access_Token有效、接口调用频次未超限2个条件符合后接受此次请求进行具体业务处理并做出响应。<br/>Token、代理商/店铺账户、User等相关关系说明介绍可查看文档【账户关系】<br/><br/>以下将介绍申请客户授权的流程：</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-pVoVfBLN\"><strong>Step1</strong>：在「<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/developer/admin/service_list\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"blank\"><span style=\"color: #1890ff;\">APPID管理</span></a>」页面选择要使用的应用程序，点击进入基本信息页面即可查看到授权URL，该页面展示的为默认申请所有权限的示例，可直接使用或自定义拼装，相关参数介绍如下：</p><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-T2XGRIVm\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-M0PJQ6Kc\">appid：申请客户授权的应用程序ID（APPID）</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-aoHQuOA2\">state：自定义参数，可用于传递自定义信息，回调时会原样带回。例如：可将客户账号作为自定义参数拼接授权URL并发送给对应客户申请授权，回调时以区分授权码对应的客户</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-yYGQC4xt\">scope：即授权范围，授权的权限范围，不传时代表当前应用拥有的所有权限，权限值对应说明可参考「<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/12/docs/1699625068225550?origin=left_nav\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"blank\"><span style=\"color: #1890ff;\">Scope权限说明</span></a>」</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-tN9n4GZO\">redirect_uri：即回调链接，由开发者自行提供和定义，需与APPID设置的回调链接一致，用于授权成功跳转并接受回调信息。</li></ul><p data-id=\"p838747a-zLYcFB6c\"><strong>Step2</strong>：将拼接完的授权URL发送给客户，引导客户访问授权URL登录User账户完成授权。 授权界面如下图：</p><p data-id=\"pa028eb2-dKEIaBIp\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img alt=\"Lark20210513-142745.png\" data-auto=\"true\" data-type=\"inline\" src=\"https://p3-business-sign.byteadimg.com/tos-cn-i-yvqzo4lhg5/757c67d1a7b8413b8c1aaf49ea4c12e6~noop.image?x-expires=1988615745&amp;x-signature=iFnoznReguhrETe5Ey5G4yM0H%2Bo%3D\" style=\"width: 2000px; visibility: visible; height: auto;\" title=\"Lark20210513-142745.png\"/></p><p data-id=\"p838747a-PlO2PT1y\"><strong>Step3</strong>：客户勾选授权账户并点击「同意授权」，页面将跳转到回调地址并带上auth_code和 state参数<br/>页面如下图：</p><p data-id=\"pa028eb2-ABcd1DHo\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img data-auto=\"true\" data-type=\"inline\" src=\"https://p26-business-sign.byteadimg.com/tos-cn-i-yvqzo4lhg5/d9486827662e4becb888a28bec7f2cf9~noop.image?x-expires=1988615745&amp;x-signature=L5bWUHtvm6km5NaVkLfv1iOynYo%3D\" style=\"width: 2000px; visibility: visible; height: auto;\"/></p><p data-id=\"p838747a-YwS6bBY9\"><strong>Tips</strong>：</p><ol data-id=\"o9d5df12-R0QUZeOe\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-bZq9ABFA\"><strong>auth_code有效期只有10分钟，且只能使用一次，过期或者多次使用都会报错</strong></li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-rYHhECVR\">授权回调链接需要与APPID设置的回调链接一致，否则访问会报错</li></ol><h2 data-id=\"h490b8bf-40pVOKjH\" id=\"link-6\">3.2 应用程序获取调用权限</h2><h3 data-id=\"h6f20189-TZ6OJLHW\" id=\"link-7\">3.2.1 如何获取Access_Token</h3><p data-id=\"p838747a-LAsTDejq\">获取到客户授权返回的auth_code后，可通过【<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710505596940\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"blank\"><span style=\"color: #1890ff;\">获取Access Token</span></a>】接口获取授权客户对应的AccessToken和RefreshToken</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-IllmGp8n\">接口请求地址：<a href=\"https://ad.oceanengine.com/open_api/oauth2/access_token/\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"blank\"><span style=\"color: #333333;\">https://ad.oceanengine.com/open_api/oauth2/access_token/</span></a></p><p data-id=\"p838747a-zjUuPZFv\">请求参数如下：</p><div class=\"table-container qz-card-type-block\"><table class=\"data-table data-table-row-header\" data-custom=\"false\" data-id=\"t3945309-W5XSmVcF\" data-transient-attributes=\"class\" data-width=\"100%\" style=\"width: 100%; outline: none; border-collapse: collapse; max-width: 100%;\"><colgroup data-id=\"c7104f7d-mmWcGGJi\"><col data-id=\"cd11d5e0-FDhiM67d\" span=\"1\" width=\"33.33333333333333%\"/><col data-id=\"cd11d5e0-QPi4hN7a\" span=\"1\" width=\"33.33333333333333%\"/><col data-id=\"cd11d5e0-krDXBM6Q\" span=\"1\" width=\"33.33333333333333%\"/></colgroup><tbody data-id=\"t6d5e859-jHUW1elO\"><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-HSYVC9bH\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"t8c0e6ab-8FGfGKmb\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-HfZAOeo8\">字段</p></td><td data-id=\"t8c0e6ab-jSWa0OQc\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-XYbd3SnR\">类型</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" data-id=\"t1b895c3-bmCBeiPT\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-UiRqOUsc\">描述</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-6JH5j46b\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-PCT2fSaj\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-IPyi1bcb\">app_id<span style=\"color: #338aff;\"><span style=\"background-color: #ebf3ff;\">必填</span></span></p></td><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-EeqWnQhM\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-joNOUwjx\">number</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t182d017-GheDI5Ma\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-YATWtP6V\">开发者申请的应用APP_ID，可通过“应用管理”界面查看</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-EiEfcpQV\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-ncYj4tVX\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-im3YHvjA\">secret<span style=\"color: #338aff;\"><span style=\"background-color: #ebf3ff;\">必填</span></span></p></td><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-sfh55POk\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-nVRkODdx\">string</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t182d017-dD2iUmqZ\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-QAVmx6dz\">开发者应用的私钥Secret，可通过“应用管理”界面查看，<span style=\"color: #f24408;\">确保填入</span><code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\"><span style=\"color: #f24408;\">secret</span></code><span style=\"color: #f24408;\">与</span><code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\"><span style=\"color: #f24408;\">app_id</span></code><span style=\"color: #f24408;\">对应以免报错</span></p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-tFkJh9ns\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-EkTD6beV\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-mmk6mLlm\">grant_type<span style=\"color: #338aff;\"><span style=\"background-color: #ebf3ff;\">必填</span></span></p></td><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-MF3SJTm6\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-kgWlD75P\">string</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t182d017-1pE51dk3\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-CfyyqWXq\">授权类型。允许值: <code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">auth_code</code></p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-sKvBDGOI\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td class=\"table-last-column\" data-id=\"t498e912-82WRTJd8\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-l49RMjRx\">auth_code<span style=\"color: #338aff;\"><span style=\"background-color: #ebf3ff;\">必填</span></span></p></td><td class=\"table-last-column\" data-id=\"t498e912-p4nOK48e\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-eD0ZhFrN\">string</p></td><td class=\"table-last-column table-last-row\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"tb7d4c2b-DaD4AZWg\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-nHuxD11M\">授权码，在授权完成后回调时会提供该授权码，只有10分钟有效期，且只能使用一次<span style=\"color: #f24408;\">确保填入</span><code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\"><span style=\"color: #f24408;\">auth_code</span></code><span style=\"color: #f24408;\">与</span><code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\"><span style=\"color: #f24408;\">app_id</span></code><span style=\"color: #f24408;\">对应以免报错</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p data-id=\"p838747a-8NMizEQZ\">请求示例：</p><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view qz-codeblock qz-card-type-block\" data-type=\"codeblock\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22wrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22language%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22theme%22%3A%22QZtheme%22%2C%22height%22%3A%22auto%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22curl%20--location%20--request%20POST%20'https%3A%2F%2Fad.oceanengine.com%2Fopen_api%2Foauth2%2Faccess_token%2F'%20%5C%5C%5Cn--header%20'Content-Type%3A%20application%2Fjson'%20%5C%5C%5Cn--data-raw%20'%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22app_id%5C%22%3A123456%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22secret%5C%22%3A%5C%22xxxx%5C%22%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22grant_type%5C%22%3A%5C%22auth_code%5C%22%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22auth_code%5C%22%3A%5C%22xxxx%5C%22%5Cn%7D'%22%2C%22id%22%3A%223fRen%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22block%22%7D\"><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view_contain qz-codeblock_inner\"><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view_scroll qz-codeblock-scroll\" style=\"height: auto; max-height: 600px; overflow-y: scroll;\"><div class=\"qz-codeblock_content plain\"></div></div></div></div><p data-id=\"p838747a-WoF7zMr1\">返回示例：</p><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view qz-codeblock qz-card-type-block\" data-type=\"codeblock\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22wrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22language%22%3A%22json%22%2C%22theme%22%3A%22QZtheme%22%2C%22height%22%3A%22auto%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%5C%22code%5C%22%3A%200%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%5C%22message%5C%22%3A%20%5C%22%5C%22%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%5C%22data%5C%22%3A%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%5C%22access_token%5C%22%3A%20%5C%22xxxxx%5C%22%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%5C%22refresh_token%5C%22%3A%20%5C%22xxxxx%5C%22%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%5C%22advertiser_id%5C%22%3A%201%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%5C%22advertiser_ids%5C%22%3A%20%5B1%2C2%2C3%5D%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%5C%22expires_in%5C%22%3A%2086400%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%5C%22refresh_token_expires_in%5C%22%3A%20604800%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%7D%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22eGvti%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22block%22%7D\"><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view_contain qz-codeblock_inner\"><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view_scroll qz-codeblock-scroll\" style=\"height: auto; max-height: 600px; overflow-y: scroll;\"><div class=\"qz-codeblock_content json\"></div></div></div></div><p data-id=\"p838747a-9P3qqztY\">获取到AccessToken之后，就可以使用AccessToken调用相关功能接口对客户进行管理操作了。 但是请注意，<strong>一旦Access_Token失效后，将无法继续调用接口操作</strong>，需要刷新获取新的AccessToken才可以继续进行相关调用操作。 Access_Token与Refresh_Token的有效期如下：</p><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-GbHfWcjW\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-lm0jupxZ\">Access_Token有效期为<strong>24小时</strong></li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-Me626oza\">Refresh_Token有效期为<strong>30天</strong></li></ul><h3 data-id=\"h6f20189-DO34ahCj\" id=\"link-8\">3.2.2 如何刷新Access_Token</h3><p data-id=\"p838747a-dgAlIDCj\">Refresh_Token在有效期内，可以通过接口【<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/12/docs/1697468248190020?origin=left_nav\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"blank\"><span style=\"color: #1890ff;\">刷新Refresh Token</span></a>】刷新Access_Token。 请求示例：</p><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view qz-codeblock qz-card-type-block\" data-type=\"codeblock\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22wrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22language%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22theme%22%3A%22QZtheme%22%2C%22height%22%3A%22auto%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22curl%20--location%20--request%20POST%20'https%3A%2F%2Fad.oceanengine.com%2Fopen_api%2Foauth2%2Frefresh_token%2F'%20%5C%5C%5Cn--header%20'Content-Type%3A%20application%2Fjson'%20%5C%5C%5Cn--data-raw%20'%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22app_id%5C%22%3A123456%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22secret%5C%22%3A%5C%22xxxx%5C%22%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22grant_type%5C%22%3A%5C%22refresh_token%5C%22%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22refresh_token%5C%22%3A%5C%22xxxx%5C%22%5Cn%7D'%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22kb91y%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22block%22%7D\"><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view_contain qz-codeblock_inner\"><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view_scroll qz-codeblock-scroll\" style=\"height: auto; max-height: 600px; overflow-y: scroll;\"><div class=\"qz-codeblock_content plain\"></div></div></div></div><p data-id=\"p838747a-4VcLp2Xw\"><strong>Tips</strong>:</p><ol data-id=\"o9d5df12-dHBWJU8b\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-vNOLL8S1\">刷新Access_Token会同时获得新的Access_Token和Refresh_Token，并且<strong>有效期都会重置</strong></li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-7GBGgiNf\">刷新成功后原Refresh_Token将不能再继续使用，<strong>再次刷新需要使用上次刷新获得的新的Refresh_Token</strong>，一旦丢失则需要申请客户授权重新获取，所以请妥善保管</li></ol></div>",
